            <div xml:id="d501-a9">

                <pb facs="0595" n="575" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg575"/>

                <p>[Enclosure No. 10.]</p>
                <p>I beg to communicate, in writing, as follows:</p>
                <p>Peace having now been established between your country’s admiral and myself at
                    Simonoseki, I have despatched envoys to you to pay my respects; and I have to
                    request that you will receive them and give them a hearing.</p>
                <p>With respect,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MATSUDAIRA DAISEN-NO-DAIBO.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>YOSITSE KA.</signed><lb/>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">l. s.</hi>] <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="japanese-nengō gregorian"
                            when="1864-08-19">Nineteenth day, 8th month, 1st year of Genji, (19th
                            August, 1864</date>.)</dateline></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">of the United States of America.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
